#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following tools can be used together to implement an error mitigation "
"technique in the directed execution model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Alat berikut boleh digunakan bersama untuk melaksanakan teknik mitigasi "
"ralat dalam model pelaksanaan terarah.\n"

